    {"id":"AN-04","source_heading":"四、电力领域数据基础设施标准体系框架设计","statement":"七类标准及其二级子体系共同覆盖共性基础、行业核心、场景应用、安全和持续治理，并与先行先试能力要求形成对应。","argument_role":"taxonomy-and-correspondence","argument_weight":"core","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-HEADING-57F6A2E04379-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-B4EB5156C5A4-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-B54D43F12D98-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-C3206BE901A9-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-6586BB672963-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-23AC4652A74F-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-5F66522E4727-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-06E5E8C6D9C1-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-343217AF661D-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-EF517B85CE1D-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-A71F1509ECBA-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-32B63A6249EC-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-DF45B5A7F76D-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-F46369CF68AC-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-25520C20E4E5-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-7F4B2818D73C-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-70762DB7164E-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-D4C0FF16886B-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-F23D5190C6EB-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-D92CDA7649BE-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-FC64911471FD-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-29E26F5D27CC-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-86E3E795A4C7-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-05FBC7E1B0AB-01"]},
    {"id":"AN-05","source_heading":"五、重点标准研制方向与优先级","statement":"标准研制按上位依据与紧迫性、规模化建设基础需求、新兴场景成熟度分为三级，并与重点场景验证同步。","argument_role":"prioritization","argument_weight":"core","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-HEADING-C03CD91851F7-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-331D290FE21D-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-5AD57A942BB1-01"]},
    {"id":"AN-06","source_heading":"六、分阶段实施路径","statement":"近期完成顶层设计和第一优先级研制，中期形成规模化流通标准供给，远期基本建成七类协同配套的主体结构。","argument_role":"maturity-progression","argument_weight":"core","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-HEADING-2272B931CA99-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-22F54C1161C7-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-9E2153E54ADE-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-4CD9E69B9968-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-86C9EDAA4984-01"]},
    {"id":"AN-07","source_heading":"七、保障措施","statement":"组织协作、动态机制、经费人才和国际衔接共同保障标准体系持续研制、实施评估与更新。","argument_role":"actor-collaboration-and-governance","argument_weight":"supporting","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-HEADING-E271ABBAF951-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-HEADING-1030F0529082-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-HEADING-00C517E3F5DE-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-HEADING-B525A29D3893-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-HEADING-79B6BAF4EA37-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-A82C6EB505C0-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-205C2633F255-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-F4CA7E36EC12-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-621211F9FB85-01"]},
    {"id":"AN-08","source_heading":"八、结论","statement":"中电联将继续动态完善体系、推进重点标准研制和实施评估，使研究成果服务先行先试和电力数据要素价值释放。","argument_role":"bounded-implication","argument_weight":"supporting","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-HEADING-0070A308216E-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-02689104A034-01"]}
