  "facts": [
    {"id":"F-01","statement":"国家数据基础设施建设以四大方向、八大能力和三阶段目标推进，并形成六项配套技术文件。","strength":"source-stated","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-F8C546989279-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-01-U1","text":"四大方向为数据流通利用、算力底座、网络支撑、安全防护。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-F8C546989279-01"},{"id":"F-01-U2","text":"八大能力覆盖采集、汇聚、传输、加工、流通、利用、运营、安全。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-F8C546989279-01"},{"id":"F-01-U3","text":"建设目标分2026、2028、2029三个节点。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-F8C546989279-01"},{"id":"F-01-U4","text":"六项技术文件覆盖参考架构、互联互通、身份、标识、连接器和目录。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-F8C546989279-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-02","statement":"中电联承担第二批先行先试成长级项目，建设三统一、主体接入、数据流通利用和安全保障能力，并承担标准验证。","strength":"source-stated","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-CB9FEF0E398E-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-02-U1","text":"项目以电力行业节点能力建设为牵引。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-CB9FEF0E398E-01"},{"id":"F-02-U2","text":"建设统一目录、统一身份、统一标识三统一能力。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-CB9FEF0E398E-01"},{"id":"F-02-U3","text":"建设主体接入、数据流通利用和安全保障能力。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-CB9FEF0E398E-01"},{"id":"F-02-U4","text":"任务包括技术创新融合、重点领域应用、标准验证和机制建设。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-CB9FEF0E398E-01"},{"id":"F-02-U5","text":"重点场景覆盖行业治理、市场运行、绿色低碳等八个方向。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-CB9FEF0E398E-01"},{"id":"F-02-U6","text":"标准验证是任务书四项核心任务之一。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-CB9FEF0E398E-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-03","statement":"企业数字化实践已形成基础，现有标准分散、衔接不足且新兴场景标准供给滞后。","strength":"source-stated","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-71CA03380F46-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-95095F8B73E0-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-03-U1","text":"国家电网以数据和数字技术构建电网数字化支撑体系。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-71CA03380F46-01"},{"id":"F-03-U2","text":"南方电网形成“基座、数据、创新、安全、AI”五大赋能能力和数字电网建设“2421”战略路径。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-71CA03380F46-01"},{"id":"F-03-U3","text":"南方电网形成数据资产管理实践并通过最高等级DCMM评价。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-71CA03380F46-01"},{"id":"F-03-U4","text":"企业建设总体呈自主推进、标准分散制定特征。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-71CA03380F46-01"},{"id":"F-03-U5","text":"现有标准分布于多个专业领域和层级。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-95095F8B73E0-01"},{"id":"F-03-U6","text":"标准衔接不足且覆盖范围不均衡。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-95095F8B73E0-01"},{"id":"F-03-U7","text":"新业态提高了体系系统性、协同性和前瞻性要求。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-95095F8B73E0-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-04","statement":"国家层面已形成顶层指引、六项技术文件、GB/T 13016方法和能源数据分类分级规则等基础。","strength":"source-stated","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-2D1E57066918-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-04-U1","text":"国家指引确立四大方向和八大能力。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-2D1E57066918-01"},{"id":"F-04-U2","text":"六项技术文件规定关键技术环节。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-2D1E57066918-01"},{"id":"F-04-U3","text":"GB/T 13016提供标准体系表编制方法。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-2D1E57066918-01"},{"id":"F-04-U4","text":"能源行业分类分级指南为电力数据资源标准提供直接依据。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-2D1E57066918-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-05","statement":"电力行业已有信息模型、数据安全、统计编码、共享交换和可靠性治理等标准与实践基础。","strength":"source-stated","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-797ABE1B854F-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-05-U1","text":"DL/T 890系列对应IEC 61970。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-797ABE1B854F-01"},{"id":"F-05-U2","text":"CIM和CIS支持电力系统资源信息交换。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-797ABE1B854F-01"},{"id":"F-05-U3","text":"T/CSAS 0012—2025《电力行业数据安全要求》已于2025年发布实施，覆盖数据全生命周期安全要求。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-797ABE1B854F-01"},{"id":"F-05-U4","text":"T/GDCSA 020—2024《电力交易数据安全分类分级管理规范》规定电力交易场景数据分类分级要求。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-797ABE1B854F-01"},{"id":"F-05-U5","text":"已有电力行业统计编码规范。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-797ABE1B854F-01"},{"id":"F-05-U6","text":"已有共享交换倡议和企业间接口规范。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-797ABE1B854F-01"},{"id":"F-05-U7","text":"国家能源局自2023年部署电力可靠性管理数据治理，明确到2025年初步建成、到2028年全面建成基于实时数据的电力可靠性管理体系。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-797ABE1B854F-01"},{"id":"F-05-U8","text":"中电联归口职责和年度立项指南提供组织渠道。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-797ABE1B854F-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-06","statement":"当前差距包括统一框架缺失、基础通用供给不足、数据资源覆盖不均、新兴场景供给滞后、实施协同机制不完善。","strength":"source-stated","group_id":"GAP-5","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-65660DD62DE9-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-7F05ED4358DA-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-7606FB82331F-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-D91A803C5D2D-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-01FE1C856B4E-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-06-U1","text":"现有标准分散于不同专业领域。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-65660DD62DE9-01"},{"id":"F-06-U2","text":"标准层级与衔接关系不明确，尚未形成统一框架。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-65660DD62DE9-01"},{"id":"F-06-U3","text":"目录、标识、身份认证、接口协议等基础共性标准不足。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-7F05ED4358DA-01"},{"id":"F-06-U4","text":"基础共性标准与国家六项技术文件衔接不足。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-7F05ED4358DA-01"},{"id":"F-06-U5","text":"目录、元数据、质量、字典等数据资源标准不健全。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-7606FB82331F-01"},{"id":"F-06-U6","text":"数据资源标准不足制约统一管理和高效利用。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-7606FB82331F-01"},{"id":"F-06-U7","text":"新兴场景数据接口、交互和服务标准研制滞后。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-D91A803C5D2D-01"},{"id":"F-06-U8","text":"企业实践与行业标准之间需要建立双向衔接。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-01FE1C856B4E-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-07","statement":"体系构建遵循顶层对接、任务牵引、行业适配、体系完整、急用先行、开放协同六项原则。","strength":"source-stated","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-3455873A54FE-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-07-U1","text":"顶层对接国家总体架构和八大能力。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-3455873A54FE-01"},{"id":"F-07-U2","text":"以先行先试任务要求牵引。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-3455873A54FE-01"},{"id":"F-07-U3","text":"适配发输变配用调业务特点。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-3455873A54FE-01"},{"id":"F-07-U4","text":"按GB/T 13016保持体系完整。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-3455873A54FE-01"},{"id":"F-07-U5","text":"急用先行安排迫切标准。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-3455873A54FE-01"},{"id":"F-07-U6","text":"前瞻布局新兴场景标准。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-3455873A54FE-01"},{"id":"F-07-U7","text":"开放协同国际标准与各层级标准。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-3455873A54FE-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-08","statement":"体系采用GB/T 13016方法，以四大方向、八大能力和先行先试能力为依据，形成七类一级体系。","strength":"source-stated","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-E272B23C7BE3-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-E2A7B348659C-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-08-U1","text":"采用GB/T 13016标准体系表编制方法。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-E272B23C7BE3-01"},{"id":"F-08-U2","text":"以四大方向和八大能力为基本坐标。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-E272B23C7BE3-01"},{"id":"F-08-U3","text":"以三统一、主体接入、数据流通利用和安全保障能力为直接依据。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-E272B23C7BE3-01"},{"id":"F-08-U4","text":"结合能源分类分级制度和发输变配用调链条。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-E272B23C7BE3-01"},{"id":"F-08-U5","text":"四梁映射国家四大方向，八柱映射全生命周期八大能力。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-E2A7B348659C-01"},{"id":"F-08-U6","text":"整体呈现为七个一级类目及二级子体系。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-E2A7B348659C-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-09","statement":"七类体系中，A/F是共性支撑，B/D体现行业核心，C/E面向具体场景，G保障持续运行。","strength":"source-stated","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-86E3E795A4C7-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-09-U1","text":"A类和F类是共性支撑基础。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-86E3E795A4C7-01"},{"id":"F-09-U2","text":"B类和D类是行业专业核心。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-86E3E795A4C7-01"},{"id":"F-09-U3","text":"C类和E类面向具体数字化场景。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-86E3E795A4C7-01"},{"id":"F-09-U4","text":"G类保障体系持续运行。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-86E3E795A4C7-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-10","statement":"重点标准按急用先行、分类推进分为三个优先级。","strength":"recommendation","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-331D290FE21D-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-10-U1","text":"按急用先行、分类推进确定研制方向。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-331D290FE21D-01"},{"id":"F-10-U2","text":"第一优先级包括参考架构实施细则、分类分级实施细则、标识和目录规范，应尽快启动立项。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-331D290FE21D-01"},{"id":"F-10-U3","text":"第二优先级包括数据字典与元数据、数据质量、连接器和全生命周期安全，建议在第一优先级发布后同步推进。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-331D290FE21D-01"},{"id":"F-10-U4","text":"第三优先级面向新兴业务场景，建议团体标准先行，成熟后转化。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-331D290FE21D-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-11","statement":"标准研制应与先行先试重点场景验证同步推进。","strength":"recommendation","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-5AD57A942BB1-01"],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-12","statement":"实施路径分近期、中期、远期三阶段，并与国家建设目标和先行先试节奏协调。","strength":"recommendation","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-22F54C1161C7-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-9E2153E54ADE-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-4CD9E69B9968-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-86C9EDAA4984-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-12-U1","text":"三阶段需与国家目标和先行先试节奏协调。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-22F54C1161C7-01"},{"id":"F-12-U2","text":"近期完成体系框架发布和第一优先级立项研制。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-9E2153E54ADE-01"},{"id":"F-12-U3","text":"近期支撑三统一和年度标准验证并开展试点。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-9E2153E54ADE-01"},{"id":"F-12-U4","text":"中期完成第二优先级发布实施并扩大企业覆盖。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-4CD9E69B9968-01"},{"id":"F-12-U5","text":"中期建立评估反馈和动态优化机制。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-4CD9E69B9968-01"},{"id":"F-12-U6","text":"远期完成第三优先级成熟转化。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-86C9EDAA4984-01"},{"id":"F-12-U7","text":"远期基本形成七类协同体系并全面衔接国家体系。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-86C9EDAA4984-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-13","statement":"中电联牵头并在主管部门指导下统筹企业、科研机构和高校，建立标准全流程协作机制。","strength":"source-stated","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-A82C6EB505C0-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-13-U1","text":"中电联在国家数据局、国家能源局指导下统筹多类参与单位。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-A82C6EB505C0-01"},{"id":"F-13-U2","text":"建立立项、起草、审查、发布、复审全流程协作机制并明确职责。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-A82C6EB505C0-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-14","statement":"保障措施涵盖动态立项与评估机制、经费人才投入、企业实践转标和国际标准衔接。","strength":"recommendation","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-205C2633F255-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-F4CA7E36EC12-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-621211F9FB85-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-14-U1","text":"建立立项动态调整、实施跟踪评估和问题反馈机制。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-205C2633F255-01"},{"id":"F-14-U2","text":"统筹科研力量、专项经费和人才投入，推动企业实践转化。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-F4CA7E36EC12-01"},{"id":"F-14-U3","text":"持续跟踪IEC 61970、IEC 61968等国际标准并参与国际标准化。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-621211F9FB85-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-15","statement":"后续由中电联动态完善框架、加快重点标准研制并强化实施评估。","strength":"planned","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-02689104A034-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-15-U1","text":"持续跟踪国家数据基础设施建设进展。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-02689104A034-01"},{"id":"F-15-U2","text":"动态完善框架并加快重点标准立项研制。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-02689104A034-01"},{"id":"F-15-U3","text":"强化实施评估并纳入先行先试整体进度。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-02689104A034-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
    {"id":"F-16","statement":"七类标准体系共列出21个二级子体系，并为每个子体系明确重点标准方向。","strength":"source-derived-count","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-BD30E6AFDFF3-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-B4EB5156C5A4-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-B54D43F12D98-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-C3206BE901A9-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-6586BB672963-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-23AC4652A74F-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-5F66522E4727-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-06E5E8C6D9C1-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-343217AF661D-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-EF517B85CE1D-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-A71F1509ECBA-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-32B63A6249EC-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-DF45B5A7F76D-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-F46369CF68AC-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-25520C20E4E5-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-7F4B2818D73C-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-70762DB7164E-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-D4C0FF16886B-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-F23D5190C6EB-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-D92CDA7649BE-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-FC64911471FD-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-29E26F5D27CC-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"F-16-U0","text":"表格列为一级类目、二级子体系、重点标准方向与说明。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-BD30E6AFDFF3-01"},{"id":"F-16-U1","text":"A1术语与概念：统一术语并衔接国家参考架构。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-B4EB5156C5A4-01"},{"id":"F-16-U2","text":"A2参考架构：制定行业实施细则与映射关系。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-B54D43F12D98-01"},{"id":"F-16-U3","text":"A3标识与目录：制定标识管理和目录描述规范。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-C3206BE901A9-01"},{"id":"F-16-U4","text":"B1数据分类分级：落实能源数据规则到电力专业链条。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-6586BB672963-01"},{"id":"F-16-U5","text":"B2数据字典与元数据：规范设备、拓扑、量测等对象。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-23AC4652A74F-01"},{"id":"F-16-U6","text":"B3数据质量：覆盖生成、采集、存储、使用全过程。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-5F66522E4727-01"},{"id":"F-16-U7","text":"B4数据资产管理：规范登记、评估、入表。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-06E5E8C6D9C1-01"},{"id":"F-16-U8","text":"C1感知与终端：规范终端和传感装置数据接入。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-343217AF661D-01"},{"id":"F-16-U9","text":"C2存储与计算：覆盖存储、算力调度及算电协同。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-EF517B85CE1D-01"},{"id":"F-16-U10","text":"C3平台与中台：制定技术导则和功能规范。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-A71F1509ECBA-01"},{"id":"F-16-U11","text":"D1接口协议：衔接国家接入连接器技术要求。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-32B63A6249EC-01"},{"id":"F-16-U12","text":"D2信息模型：继承扩展DL/T 890公共信息模型。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-DF45B5A7F76D-01"},{"id":"F-16-U13","text":"D3身份与接入管理：制定行业实施细则。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-F46369CF68AC-01"},{"id":"F-16-U14","text":"E1数据流通交易：规范共享、流通、交易。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-25520C20E4E5-01"},{"id":"F-16-U15","text":"E2新兴场景应用：规范新兴场景接口与服务。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-7F4B2818D73C-01"},{"id":"F-16-U16","text":"E3公共服务：规范可靠性和统计数据发布共享。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-70762DB7164E-01"},{"id":"F-16-U17","text":"F1数据安全总体要求：完善行业安全标准体系。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-D4C0FF16886B-01"},{"id":"F-16-U18","text":"F2全生命周期安全：覆盖采集、传输、存储、使用、销毁。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-F23D5190C6EB-01"},{"id":"F-16-U19","text":"F3跨域安全：规范跨企业、跨行业、跨境流通。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-D92CDA7649BE-01"},{"id":"F-16-U20","text":"G1治理机制：规范组织、职责、流程。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-FC64911471FD-01"},{"id":"F-16-U21","text":"G2标准化协同管理：规范立项、归口、实施评估和职责分工。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-TABLE-ROW-29E26F5D27CC-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"}
