    {"id":"CT-01","statement":"研究中的优先级和实施措施多为建议或计划，不能表述为已立项、已发布或已全面实施。","strength":"boundary","source_refs":["SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-331D290FE21D-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-9E2153E54ADE-01","SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-02689104A034-01"],"semantic_units":[{"id":"CT-01-U1","text":"第一优先级应尽快启动立项。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-331D290FE21D-01"},{"id":"CT-01-U2","text":"第二优先级建议在第一优先级发布后同步推进。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-331D290FE21D-01"},{"id":"CT-01-U3","text":"第三优先级建议团体标准先行。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-331D290FE21D-01"},{"id":"CT-01-U4","text":"近期目标是完成框架发布。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-9E2153E54ADE-01"},{"id":"CT-01-U5","text":"近期目标是完成第一优先级立项研制。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-9E2153E54ADE-01"},{"id":"CT-01-U6","text":"近期计划选取条件具备的企业和区域试点。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-9E2153E54ADE-01"},{"id":"CT-01-U7","text":"后续将动态完善框架。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-02689104A034-01"},{"id":"CT-01-U8","text":"后续将加快重点标准立项研制。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-02689104A034-01"},{"id":"CT-01-U9","text":"后续将强化实施评估。","source_unit_ref":"SU-B56DFFEECD-PARAGRAPH-02689104A034-01"}],"visibility":"unspecified"},
